course: dictionary
lesson: 14121
title: A word with a warning
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and some can hurt people. Midget is one of them. In old books it may be used as a word for a very short person, but today that use is hurtful and should never be used about people.
explain: For people, say «a person of short stature» or «a person with dwarfism». For things, the word still appears, as in «a midget submarine», but «mini» is the safer choice. Context tells you the meaning: «The museum had a midget submarine from the war.» A submarine is not a person, so midget means very small for its kind.
explain: Check the sentence by swapping in «very small». If the word is about a person, do not use it at all. Always ask whether your word could hurt someone.
fact: Midget can be a noun or an adjective.
fact: «Midget» as an adjective means very small for its kind, as in «a midget submarine».
fact: «Midget» about a person is offensive; today it is considered hurtful, so do not use it.
fact: Say «a person of short stature» or «a person with dwarfism» instead.
fact: «Mini» is a safer word for small things, such as «a mini fridge».
exercise: «The museum had a midget submarine from the war.» What does midget mean here? | Very loud | A very tall person | Made of wood | *Very small for its kind
exercise: What is the kindest way to describe a person who is very short? | *A person of short stature | Calling them a midget | Making jokes about their height | Calling them tiny like a toy
exercise: Which word is a safer choice than midget for a small thing, such as a fridge? | Huge | Heavy | Loud | *Mini
test: «The shop sold a midget racing car that fitted in your hand.» Which word could replace midget without changing the meaning? | Slow | *Tiny | Enormous | Expensive
test: Why should you not use midget about people? | Nobody knows what it means | It is a long word | It means happy | *It is hurtful and considered rude today
exam: Which is the best way to talk about a person who is very short? | *A person with dwarfism | Midget | Shorty | Titchy
